Section: 5 CONCLUSION
Text: It is worth noting though that the improvement over a smaller range of {256, 384, 512} was rather marginal (0.3%). The test set performance is reported and compared with other approaches in Table 11. Our networks “Net-D” and “Net-E” exhibit identical performance on VOC datasets, and their combination slightly improves the results. Our methods set the new state of the art across image representations, pre- trained on the ILSVRC dataset, outperforming the previous best result of Chatﬁeld et al.

